
/*
QUERY NAME: Courses Created Between April and July 2026

PURPOSE:
Retrieves Blackboard Learn courses created between
April 1, 2026, and July 31, 2026.

DATA SOURCE:
- CDM_LMS.COURSE: Contains course identifiers,
  course numbers, and creation timestamps.

FIELDS RETURNED:
- Batch UID: Blackboard course batch identifier
  extracted from the COURSE.STAGE JSON field.
- Course Number: Blackboard course number.
- Created Time: Date and time the course was created.

FILTERING:
- Includes courses created after April 1, 2026,
  at midnight.
- Includes courses created before August 1, 2026.
- No course availability, enabled, or deletion
  filters are applied.

SORTING:
- No ORDER BY clause is specified.
- Results are not guaranteed to be in date order.

NOTES:
- The query includes courses created during
  April through July 2026.
- The exact timestamp of April 1 at 00:00:00
  is excluded by the > operator.
- Courses created on or after August 1 are excluded.
- Batch UID values are extracted from STAGE JSON data.
*/

SELECT
    TRIM(CDM_LMS.COURSE.STAGE['batch_uid'], '"') AS "Batch UID",
    CDM_LMS.COURSE.COURSE_NUMBER AS "Course Number",
    CDM_LMS.COURSE.CREATED_TIME AS "Created Time"

FROM CDM_LMS.COURSE

WHERE
    CREATED_TIME > TO_DATE('2026-04-01', 'YYYY-MM-DD')
    AND CREATED_TIME < TO_DATE('2026-08-01', 'YYYY-MM-DD');
